kargo-kotlin-server
Kargo's Kotlin language server. Licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0, at
your option, like Kargo.

It bundles, in lib/, components under their own licenses:

- The Kotlin Analysis API, the Kotlin compiler frontend and the IntelliJ Platform core, as
  packaged in com.google.devtools.ksp:symbol-processing-aa (Apache License 2.0).
  https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin, https://github.com/google/ksp
- The Kotlin standard library and kotlinx.coroutines (Apache License 2.0).
- Eclipse LSP4J (Eclipse Public License 2.0 or Eclipse Distribution License 1.0).
  https://github.com/eclipse-lsp4j/lsp4j
- Gson (Apache License 2.0). https://github.com/google/gson

The license texts are at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0,
https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/ and https://www.eclipse.org/org/documents/edl-v10.php.
